Points To Consider:
> When we have situation of inheritance and two or more child can have
duplicate functionality then we should consider the approach of strategy design pattern.Here if we see that driving strategy
of a vehicle can be same for two or more so for every possible driving we created a class and then which child wants to use it can use as has a relation ship.

> Use the Strategy Pattern over inheritance when you want to vary an object’s behavior dynamically,
 avoid code duplication, and keep your codebase flexible and maintainable.